msgstr "Gestión visual de canalizaciones Kanban"

#: admin/settings.php:2674
msgid "Switch between Table View and Kanban Pipeline on the All Captured Leads page. Drag lead cards between stages (New -> Contacted -> Follow-Up -> Qualified -> Won). Each card features 1-click WhatsApp chat, direct phone dial, and PDF receipt downloads."
